---
export const prerender = true;
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
---

<Content
  kicker="Legal"
  title="Payouts & Withdrawals"
  description="Current status of Saathum withdrawals and payout semantics."
  image="/og/payouts.png"
  lead="Withdrawal semantics are not yet available; token balances remain internal account balances."
  updated="2026-08-05"
  helpHref="/help"
>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.c09f2e94e0a3c15d">This page explains how withdrawals work on Saathum. It sits alongside our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>, <a data-i18n="web-payouts.188dc350278985ab" href="/tokens">Tokens &amp; Wallet</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.6ff532f01420d686">policy,</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.9990ef8acf0108bc" href="/refunds">Refunds &amp; Cancellations</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.16047a3f9597e500">policy, and</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.5e2a4b33bff1936b" href="/pricing-fees">Pricing &amp; Fees</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.2c0560d6168d330b">page.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <div class="note">
    <p>
      <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.4b4d6cfd8c0b12b7">Withdrawals are not yet available.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.ac15c4a99a2c72a0">Saathum currently makes no promise of cash
      redemption, payout method, fee, tax treatment, timing, or conversion for token balances.</ui-copy>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.ed655b8c47968463" id="status">1. Who pays you</h2>

  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.71333e7857f52c57">
    Payouts are made by Ava Global International, Inc., a Delaware corporation, subject to the
    applicable product terms and payment-provider requirements.
  </p>
  <div class="note">
    <p>
      <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.92920fb143afdf45">Withdrawal semantics are not yet available.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.fefe12ef80545607">Do not treat Saathum as a source of
      payout income or infer a payout workflow from older content.</ui-copy>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.f34196c1852073a7">2. Who can withdraw</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.f688063f76013d23">
    No account can currently request a withdrawal through Saathum. Token balances are internal
    balances, and existing balances and legacy records are preserved while payout semantics are being
    finalized.
  </p>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.18778f7bcc7501e4">The fixed customer-facing value is</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.1333886bf7b67378">1 Token = ₹1</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.5e84871e5063f028">. It is not currently a withdrawal or
    redemption workflow.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.f80b0037584fdd8b">3. Supported payout methods</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.90317c517488b8dd">
    No payout method is currently promised or enabled by this page. Do not infer UPI, bank transfer,
    card payout, minimums, fees, or timelines from older help content.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.e185e008886aa904">
    If payout functionality is introduced, its Indian-rupee amount and terms will be shown before
    confirmation.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.028bd0aca11d5b84">
    Please make sure the payout details you enter are correct. A payout sent to valid but incorrect
    address that you supplied may not be recoverable.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.d65134c6b479e6ca">4. Availability</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.6400bc0986b821e8">
    Withdrawal availability is not yet implemented. When it changes, this page will describe the
    supported flow and any Indian-rupee amount shown before confirmation.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.1d67959d86c797ed">5. Future verification</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.8604ccbf07ebb308">Any future payout flow may include identity or account verification, but no withdrawal workflow is
    currently available. Information collected for any future flow will be handled under our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.506ff394621596dd" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.c2748966abe79b8f">6. Future fees and taxes</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.4032e3a220491b3c">
    No withdrawal fee, tax calculation, net payout, or provider charge is promised at this stage.
    Future checkout or payout screens will be authoritative for the transaction they quote.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.e0db46bce627264d">
    A token reversal is not a payout. It returns the exact token amount recorded for the original
    transaction and does not recalculate its Token value later.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.6d83dd7b363be330">7. Tax withholding</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.3a9ebee399098d2f">
    Where tax law requires withholding on marketplace payouts, we may
    withhold the required amount and remit it to the authorities. Similar withholding may apply in
    other jurisdictions where the law requires it. We may ask you for tax details before releasing a
    payout, and we may decline a payout until they are provided.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.b8e6ccdddfbbcaa0">
    You are responsible for your own tax position, including declaring your earnings and paying any
    tax due on them. Nothing on this page is tax advice.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.f17521bda50570df">8. Minimum balance</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.898d8d6f93a66549">
    No minimum withdrawable balance is currently defined because withdrawals are not available.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.4fda8955a341ac22">9. Timelines</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.cf422450fc91219d">
    No payout timeline is currently offered.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.8dbc147a1c178438">10. Failed or returned payouts</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.8a482f0f3c55a649">
    There is no payout workflow to fail or return at present. Any future implementation will define
    its failure handling before it becomes available.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.ab2e3e087e957803">11. Fraud, AML, and holds</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.7861902c7ac7cfdc">We may delay, hold, reduce, or decline a payout where we reasonably suspect fraud, money
    laundering, sanctions exposure, abuse of the platform, or a breach of our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.f94ad5a13ade19d5">, or where we are required or permitted to do so by law or
    by a payment partner. We may also set off amounts you owe us — for example a chargeback, a
    reversed transaction, or a refund we have issued to a customer — against a pending payout.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.9cabc45e1c7ecf04">12. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.73ee27295f2ed9be">
    We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the updated version here and revise
    the "Last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.6307b59edd6550a5">13. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.ba76a68328a5305b">Payout and billing questions:</ui-copy> <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.a2bd067f82126b7a">. General
    enquiries:</ui-copy> <a href="mailto:hello@avatok.ai">hello@avatok.ai</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.bf2fb03dedc02906">. See also our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.188dc350278985ab" href="/tokens">Tokens &amp; Wallet</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.6d122f7fa28a3b2f">policy and</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.5e2a4b33bff1936b" href="/pricing-fees">Pricing &amp; Fees</a>.
  </p>
</Content>
